# The apps tier: the rest of upstream's omarchy-base.packages that exists for
# aarch64 and is not needed to bring the session up.
#
# Installed by default, because "get it running as Omarchy is" means Omarchy's
# applications and not just its compositor. Skipped by
# `./scripts/vm-build.sh --session-only`, which is the flag to reach for while
# iterating on the session: chromium, libreoffice-fresh and kdenlive alone are
# most of the download, and none of them decide whether Hyprland starts.
